       }
      ],
      "text": "Peds (febrile seizures):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " sz ≥ 5 min: IV lorazepam, rectal diazepam or intranasal midazolam; lorazepam may be repeated q5–10 min, up to 3 doses; ⍉IV access or prehospital, > 2 y: diazepam rectal gel or intranasal midazolam."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
